  - quote: "UAT-8616 attempted to add SSH keys, modify NETCONF configurations, and escalate to root privileges."
    publisher: "Cisco Talos"
    source_url: "https://blog.talosintelligence.com/sd-wan-ongoing-exploitation/"
verification: multi-source
sourcing_note: "Cisco's advisory is the source for the flaw, versions and exploitation; Rapid7 (the discoverer) for the mechanism; Cisco Talos for the attribution; CISA's catalog independently records exploitation."
